{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_01",
      "hash": "557f619c8abb9067",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哎～！\\n属于我的时代竟然如此短暂！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_04",
      "hash": "557f5c9c8abb87e8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "从现在起，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]将成为\\n真正的冠军！\\c\\n而我，\\n也发现了今后新的目标！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_01",
      "hash": "b00cec58886a7564",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_02",
      "hash": "b00cef58886a7a7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：你终于做到了！\\n我由衷地祝贺你\\r\\n称霸了宝可梦联盟！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_08",
      "hash": "b00ce558886a697f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "比起刚刚捕获[VAR POKNAME(0002)]后\\n启程收集宝可梦图鉴时的你，\\r\\n现在的你真的成长了不少！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_09",
      "hash": "b00ce458886a67cc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你真的是长大了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_03",
      "hash": "b00cee58886a78ca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\n直到最后一刻都没有放弃，\\r\\n你做得非常好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_10",
      "hash": "b009e7588868370e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你的作战之中……\\n对宝可梦和[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\r\\n投入了太多的友善之意。\\c\\n或许就只是这些许的破绽，\\n才导致你没能赢得胜利吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_04",
      "hash": "b00ce958886a704b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你们两个的对战\\n都十分精彩！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_02",
      "hash": "557f629c8abb921a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：……是！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_05",
      "hash": "b00ce858886a6e98",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\c\\n你应该也明白……\\n你能称霸宝可梦联盟的原因，\\r\\n不单单只有你个人的努力！\\c\\n你与宝可梦绝妙的搭配，\\n也是让人刮目相看啊！\\c\\n那么……[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n请你跟我来吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_03",
      "hash": "557f639c8abb93cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哎～！\\n果然还是你厉害啊！\\c\\n不过我可不会放弃！\\n我一定会一次又一次地挑战冠军的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_06",
      "hash": "b00ceb58886a73b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_07",
      "hash": "b00cea58886a71fe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "恭喜你称霸宝可梦联盟！\\c\\n为了保住这冠军的宝座，\\n你必定付出了\\r\\n远比常人更多的努力！\\c\\n为了表彰你的奋斗，\\n请你跟我来吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p02_cave_d1405",
      "hash": "564e959046db4e49",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 14]"
